   "title": "CHARACTER LOCK \u2014 who Seth is",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Redraw the character in image 1 as a single full-body cartoon figure, keeping his identity exactly: a lanky cartoon man with long wavy shoulder-length brown hair and a full bushy handlebar moustache, wearing a plain v-neck t-shirt of very dark olive charcoal \u2014 near-black, the same flat dark tone as the t-shirt in image 1 \u2014 with warm grey trousers and black-and-white sneakers. Keep his face, hair, moustache, build and clothing identical to image 1, and keep every colour as muted and desaturated as image 1. The new drawing shows him as follows:"
